Lyrimuse for Android
====================

An independent Android port of Lyrimuse (https://github.com/Yudaotor/lyrimuse),
the macOS menu-bar lyrics app by Yudaotor and contributors.

This port is a clean-room reimplementation in Java against the Android framework:
it shares no source code with the macOS Swift app or its Go engine. It reuses the
same public lyric sources (LRCLIB, NetEase Cloud Music) and follows the upstream
project's GPL-3.0 licence, which is included in LICENSE.

Trademarks, player names and lyric content belong to their respective owners.
